  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "**简体中文** · [English](README.en.md)"
    },
    {
      "section": "PPT",
      "text": "**给出材料，拿到可以交付的演示文稿。**\n\n[](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-ppt) [](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-ppt) [](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-ppt)\n\n**[安装使用](#安装) · [使用流程](#开始使用) · [完整说明](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ppt/blob/master/docs/REFERENCE.zh.md)**"
    },
    {
      "section": "PPT",
      "text": "<picture>\n  <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 640px)\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ppt/master/docs/assets/intro/workflow-zh-mobile-dark.svg\">\n  <source media=\"(max-width: 640px)\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ppt/master/docs/assets/intro/workflow-zh-mobile-light.svg\">\n  <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ppt/master/docs/assets/intro/workflow-zh-dark.svg\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ppt/master/docs/assets/intro/workflow-zh-light.svg\" alt=\"给出材料，拿到可以交付的演示文稿。 · 流程示意\" width=\"100%\">\n</picture>"
    },
    {
      "section": "功能",
      "text": "- 生成 HTML 放映、可编辑 PPTX 与工程包。\n- 按需编辑文字、图片与页序，支持撤销。\n- 可选数字溯源、现场推演、AI 预审与答辩演练。\n\n<details>\n<summary>查看实际示例</summary>\n\n图片来自验证环境的真实界面或示例 PPTX 渲染，使用示例数据。\n\n</details>"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "在 DSH 桌面版「插件」面板安装 `dsh-ppt`。已配置命令行时也可使用：\n\n```bash\ndsh plugin --profile desktop add dsh-ppt\n```\n\n网页版把 `desktop` 改为 `web`；安装后重启对应的 DSH。宿主要求以包声明 `>=0.2.1-rc.3` 为准。"
    },
    {
      "section": "开始使用",
      "text": "1. 在目标工作区提供材料、用途、听众和页数，例如“做成可交付的演示文稿，生成 HTML、PPTX 和工程文件”。\n2. 从左侧栏打开“演示文稿”，在工程库搜索或选择生成的项目。\n3. 选择页面编辑文字、图片或顺序，保存后核对预览；需要时渲染当前 PPTX 检查实际画面。\n4. 按需要主动开启 AI 预审、模拟答辩或看图修复；直接下载成品不要求这些步骤。\n5. 下载“分享成品包”交付，或下载“完整工程包”保留编辑能力；在目标播放器或 Office 中再核对一次。\n\n可以这样说：\n\n> 根据这些材料制作演示文稿，提供 HTML、可编辑 PPTX 和工程包，先确认听众与页数。"
    },
    {
      "section": "开始前要知道",
      "text": "可直接下载成品；AI 预审与演练按需开启。Office 修改不会自动同步回工程。\n\n配置、完整工具与排错见[详细使用说明](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ppt/blob/master/docs/REFERENCE.zh.md)。"
    },
    {
      "section": "插件更新",
      "text": "在工作台或原生插件详情页底部检查更新。默认自动检查，**默认不自动安装**；是否安装、何时重启由你决定。Suite 管理的组件随整包更新。[查看更新规则](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ppt/blob/master/docs/REFERENCE.zh.md)。"
    },
    {
      "section": "文档",
      "text": "- [详细使用、配置与边界](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ppt/blob/master/docs/REFERENCE.zh.md)\n- [更新记录](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ppt/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md)\n- [验证范围与历史](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ppt/blob/master/docs/VALIDATION.md)"
    },
    {
      "section": "反馈与贡献",
      "text": "如果插件帮到了你，欢迎 Star，让更多人发现它。问题和建议请提交 [Issues](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ppt/issues)，也欢迎代码与文档 [PR](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ppt/pulls)。反馈时附上版本与复现步骤，并移除凭据。"
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "[MIT](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ppt/blob/master/LICENSE)\n\n<a id=\"依赖与配置\"></a>"
    },
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "[简体中文](README.md) · **English**"
    },
    {
      "section": "PPT",
      "text": "**Bring your material. Leave with a presentation you can deliver.**\n\n[](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-ppt) [](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-ppt) [](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-ppt)\n\n**[Install](#install) · [Workflow](#start-using-it) · [Full guide](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ppt/blob/master/docs/REFERENCE.en.md)**"
    },
    {
      "section": "PPT",
      "text": "<picture>\n  <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 640px)\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ppt/master/docs/assets/intro/workflow-en-mobile-dark.svg\">\n  <source media=\"(max-width: 640px)\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ppt/master/docs/assets/intro/workflow-en-mobile-light.svg\">\n  <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ppt/master/docs/assets/intro/workflow-en-dark.svg\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ppt/master/docs/assets/intro/workflow-en-light.svg\" alt=\"Bring your material. Leave with a presentation you can deliver. · workflow illustration\" width=\"100%\">\n</picture>"
    },
    {
      "section": "Features",
      "text": "- Generate HTML slides, editable PPTX and a project bundle.\n- Optionally edit text, images and slide order with undo.\n- Choose traceable data, live scenarios, AI review or rehearsal when needed.\n\n<details>\n<summary>See a workbench example</summary>\n\nActual interface with controlled validation data; the PPTX image is a rendered sample when shown.\n\n</details>"
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "Open **Plugins** in the DSH desktop app and install `dsh-ppt`. If the CLI is available:\n\n```bash\ndsh plugin --profile desktop add dsh-ppt\n```\n\nFor the web profile, replace `desktop` with `web`. Restart that DSH profile after installation. The package’s DSH requirement is `>=0.2.1-rc.3`."
    },
    {
      "section": "Start using it",
      "text": "1. Provide material, purpose, audience and slide count in the target workspace; request HTML, PPTX and project files.\n2. Open Presentations in the sidebar and search for or select the generated project.\n3. Edit slide text, images or order, save and inspect the preview; render the current PPTX when you need to inspect its actual output.\n4. Explicitly start optional AI review, rehearsal or visual repair when needed; direct download does not require them.\n5. Deliver the share bundle or retain editability with the project bundle; check the result in the target browser or Office application."
    },
    {
      "section": "Start using it",
      "text": "Example request：\n\n> Create a deck from this material with HTML, editable PPTX and a project bundle. Confirm the audience and slide count first."
    },
    {
      "section": "Before you start",
      "text": "Download the finished deck directly; AI review and rehearsal are optional. Office edits do not sync back into the project.\n\nConfiguration, detailed tools and troubleshooting: [full reference](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ppt/blob/master/docs/REFERENCE.en.md)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Plugin updates",
      "text": "Check updates at the bottom of the workbench or native plugin details. Automatic checks are on by default; **automatic installation is off**. You choose whether to install and when to restart. Suite-managed components update with their bundle. [Update behavior](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ppt/blob/master/docs/REFERENCE.en.md)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Documentation",
      "text": "- [Full usage, configuration and limits](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ppt/blob/master/docs/REFERENCE.en.md)\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ppt/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md)\n- [Validation scope and history](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ppt/blob/master/docs/VALIDATION.md)"
    },
    {
      "section": "Feedback and contributions",
      "text": "If the plugin helps, a Star makes it easier for others to discover. Report problems or suggest improvements in [Issues](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ppt/issues); code and documentation [PRs](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ppt/pulls) are welcome. Include versions and reproduction steps, and remove credentials from reports."
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "[MIT](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-ppt/blob/master/LICENSE)\n\n<a id=\"what-it-does\"></a>\n<a id=\"requirements-and-configuration\"></a>"
    }
